  "originalTitle": "Dos + Dos",
  "overview": "Adrián and Julieta are a model married couple… on the surface. He’s a renowned plastic surgeon with an easily bruised ego. She’s a weather presenter who has spent years forecasting emotional storms at home. After seventeen years together, their conversations feel more like boxing matches than romantic dates. Until dinner with their best friends, Tomás and Silvia, changes the rules of the game. Over a glass of wine, their friends announce with beaming smiles that they’re swingers. They swap partners and are happier than ever. Between Adrián’s scepticism and Julieta’s dangerous curiosity, the idea starts buzzing around like a fly at the dinner table. What initially seems like immoral madness becomes an unexpected chance to rekindle the spark—or cause a short circuit.",
